{"id":"ccf84662da3832c0","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-FS-consistency.md","title":"FS相对于有限迭代真理的一致性","display":"thm-FS-consistency — FS相对于有限迭代真理的一致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-FS-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-FS-consistency"],"display":"thm-FS-consistency — FS相对于有限迭代真理的一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-thm-FS-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-FS-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-FS-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-FS-consistency — FS相对于有限迭代真理的一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e17f40587f032600\" href=\"?note=e17f40587f032600\" title=\"91-thm-FS-strength\">91-thm-FS-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-FS-consistency-—-FS-相对于有限迭代真理的一致性\">thm-FS-consistency — FS 相对于有限迭代真理的一致性</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span> (标准 Friedman–Sheard 理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (全部有限层迭代真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(U,V)\\coloneqq\n\\forall p\\,[\\mathrm{Prf}_U(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\n\\to\\exists q\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_V(q,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)]\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(U,V)\\coloneqq\n\\forall p\\,[\\mathrm{Prf}_U(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\n\\to\\exists q\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_V(q,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)]\\)</span>\n(把矛盾证明有效归约到比较理论)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS})\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS})\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明变换把任一有限 FS 推导只需的真理迭代深度界定在某个有限层，\n从而把 FS 的矛盾证明送成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 的矛盾证明；这里陈述\n的是元理论相对一致性。若要得到某个基础算术内部的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> 蕴含，\n还必须在该基础中表示并验证证明变换。\n这与两者算术后果等价的强度分析相协调。</p>\n<p>句法一致性与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性必须区分。标准 FS 可以一致，却由\nMcGee 定理是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致的；因此不能把 FS 的一致性等同于\nPA 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性，也不能声称 PA 逐层证明某个未定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_n\\)</span> 序列就完成了 FS 一致性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-FS-consistency-—-FS-相对于有限迭代真理的一致性","text":"thm-FS-consistency — FS 相对于有限迭代真理的一致性","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-FS-strength","status":"resolved","id":"e17f40587f032600","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-FS-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(U,V)\\coloneqq\n\\forall p\\,[\\mathrm{Prf}_U(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\n\\to\\exists q\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_V(q,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega})\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega})\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS})\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_n","display":false}],"bytes":1790,"backlinks":[{"id":"6490c20309820655","anchor":"ref-3","loca